# Ubuntu packages for the Netlify build image.
# Installed by netlify-plugin-apt before the build command runs.
#
# The website prebuild generates the source-snippet manifest by running
# tools/source-snippets, an Erlang-target Gleam CLI.  Gleam compiles to
# Erlang source and then invokes erlc/escript, neither of which ships in
# Netlify's image.  erlang-base provides both plus the BEAM runtime.
erlang-base
